# Link-check ignore list (regex per line) for the "Check Links" workflow.
# lychee auto-loads this file. Keep entries documented so they can be revisited.

# Private repo: exists but is not public, so anonymous lychee gets a 404.
github\.com/openfinance-os/velox

# Bot-hostile external sites: these load fine in a browser but fail in lychee
